  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORCAP - Access to clean energy and support to sutainable humanitarian response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Deployment of international experts to support climate services and energy in emergencies in Africa south of Sahara and Ukraine. The experts will support a variety of institutions and organizations working on weather forcast and climate services in humanitarian settings like refugee camps. Through institutional capacity buliding this program wil also contribute to climate adaptation. One of the programs, The Accelerator Program, will  focus on female energy experts. NORCAP is experiencing a rapidly increasing demand for energy advisory services in refugee camps and areas of displacement.</narrative>
  </description>
